From: with-at-porter <with-at@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 23:38:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat: add CNS protocol (outbound + inbound)

Outbound type: cns from changliuxian/mihomo-cns (HTTP handshake, XOR TCP,
UDP-over-TCP). Inbound listeners type: cns (AiziChen/CNS).

Camouflage Host is written into the CONNECT request-line
(CONNECT host:443) so carrier DPI does not classify the tunnel as
generic HTTP-proxy traffic. Real destination stays in Proxy_key.
